OL,3,GNEWSAMerseyside pub could be named as
OL,4,A'pub of the year'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA much-loved pub is in the running for
OL,7,Fone of the country's most prestigious
OL,8,Fpub honours, after reaching the final
OL,9,Fstage of a national competition.
OL,11,FThe Turks Head, in St Helens, is one of
OL,12,Fjust four pubs shortlisted for the
OL,13,FCampaign for Real Ale (CAMRA) National
OL,14,FPub of the Year award.
OL,16,FThe Tudor-style venue, which dates back
OL,17,Fto the 1870s, has already gone one
OL,18,Fbetter than previous years by
OL,19,Fprogressing beyond the regional stage
OL,20,Fto the final four.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
